{"logId": "f988de0c-3d50-43a1-af49-4065835eebc0", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1192, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "贾伟", "block_bbox": [445, 56, 540, 103], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[445.0, 56.0], [540.0, 56.0], [540.0, 103.0], [445.0, 103.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "男 | 年龄：29岁 | 15613131123 | 1561313131@163.com", "block_bbox": [205, 129, 780, 156], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[205.0, 129.0], [780.0, 129.0], [780.0, 156.0], [205.0, 156.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6年工作经验 | 求职意向：Python | 期望薪资：3-5K | 期望城市：衡水", "block_bbox": [197, 165, 788, 192], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 165.0], [788.0, 165.0], [788.0, 192.0], [197.0, 192.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "个人优势", "block_bbox": [44, 235, 169, 270], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[44.0, 235.0], [169.0, 235.0], [169.0, 270.0], [44.0, 270.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "熟练掌握 Python 后端（Django + DRF、FastAPI + Tortoise-ORM）、Vue3、MySQL、Redis、Docker，具备前后端开发与部署能力；熟练使用 PS、AE、PR，能完成图片处理、视频剪辑与动效制作；掌握 Revit、Blender，具备三维建模与可视化基础；熟练 Office，学习能力强，协作高效。", "block_bbox": [42, 305, 1138, 404], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[42.0, 305.0], [1138.0, 305.0], [1138.0, 404.0], [42.0, 404.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "工作经历", "block_bbox": [45, 453, 168, 487], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[45.0, 453.0], [168.0, 453.0], [168.0, 487.0], [45.0, 487.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2020.07-2024.04", "block_bbox": [984, 523, 1146, 548], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[984.0, 523.0], [1146.0, 523.0], [1146.0, 548.0], [984.0, 548.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "铁路道床建模，房建建筑模型建模以及制作讲解施工工艺的三维动画视频等", "block_bbox": [43, 600, 686, 626], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[43.0, 600.0], [686.0, 600.0], [686.0, 626.0], [43.0, 626.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "业绩：", "block_bbox": [44, 643, 102, 668], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[44.0, 643.0], [101.0, 643.0], [101.0, 667.0], [44.0, 667.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "工作业绩：", "block_bbox": [44, 679, 136, 704], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[44.0, 679.0], [135.0, 679.0], [135.0, 703.0], [44.0, 703.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 负责多种铁路道床的3D建模工作，使用Revit完成大铁铺架施工工艺动画、自密实道床施工工艺动画、钢轨闪光焊施工工艺动画等，提升施工可视化与技术交底效率", "block_bbox": [43, 715, 1139, 776], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[43.0, 715.0], [1139.0, 715.0], [1139.0, 776.0], [43.0, 776.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 参与房建项目投标工作，完成BIM建筑模型的建模任务，助力项目技术方案展示与投标竞争力提升", "block_bbox": [43, 787, 897, 813], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[43.0, 787.0], [897.0, 787.0], [897.0, 813.0], [43.0, 813.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 在施工工艺动画制作过程中，结合BIM技术优化施工流程表达，提高施工团队对工艺要点的理解与执行准确性", "block_bbox": [43, 823, 990, 849], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[43.0, 823.0], [990.0, 823.0], [990.0, 849.0], [43.0, 849.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "项目经历", "block_bbox": [44, 899, 169, 932], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[44.0, 899.0], [169.0, 899.0], [169.0, 932.0], [44.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "SimpleYun 简易网盘（个人项目） 全栈工程师", "block_bbox": [42, 966, 553, 996], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[42.0, 966.0], [553.0, 966.0], [553.0, 996.0], [42.0, 996.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2026.05-2026.08", "block_bbox": [985, 968, 1145, 992], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[985.0, 968.0], [1145.0, 968.0], [1145.0, 992.0], [985.0, 992.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "内容：", "block_bbox": [44, 1011, 102, 1037], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[44.0, 1011.0], [101.0, 1011.0], [101.0, 1036.0], [44.0, 1036.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "SimpleYun 简易网盘 | 后端：Python / FastAPI / Tortoise-ORM / Redis / SAQ；前端：Vue 3 / Pinia / Vite", "block_bbox": [42, 1046, 980, 1072], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[42.0, 1046.0], [980.0, 1046.0], [980.0, 1072.0], [42.0, 1072.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "独立完成前后端：分片上传与断点续传、内容寻址秒传、挑战应答与随机采样、多用户共享（多对多+分布式锁）、JWT认证与权限分级。", "block_bbox": [42, 1082, 1126, 1142], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[42.0, 1082.0], [1126.0, 1082.0], [1126.0, 1142.0], [42.0, 1142.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "后端约4600行/31条接口。", "block_bbox": [44, 1154, 302, 1180], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[44.0, 1154.0], [302.0, 1154.0], [302.0, 1180.0], [44.0, 1180.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "业绩：", "block_bbox": [44, 1197, 100, 1222], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[43.999996185302734, 1196.9998779296875], [98.99998474121094, 1196.9998779296875], [98.99998474121094, 1220.9998779296875], [43.999996185302734, 1220.9998779296875]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "设计并实现分片上传全链路，包括初始化、幂等分片、进度查询及后台合并，支持断点续传与三路并发上传。合并流程剥离至独立worker进程，确保接口即时返回，提升系统响应效率。", "block_bbox": [43, 1232, 1145, 1294], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[43.0, 1232.0], [1145.0, 1232.0], [1145.0, 1294.0], [43.0, 1294.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "定位并修复一个并发数据丢失缺陷，通过编写最小复现脚本稳定复现“10个分片并发后进度只剩1个”的问题。经实测排除数据库原子表达式（三种写法均报错），最终采用事务+行锁方式串行化临界区，以相同脚本验证10次无丢失，合并文件SHA-256与原始分片逐字节一致。", "block_bbox": [42, 1339, 1136, 1438], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[42.0, 1339.0], [1136.0, 1339.0], [1136.0, 1438.0], [42.0, 1438.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "实现内容寻址秒传功能，基于文件 SHA-256 进行复用，命中后实现零传输完成。关键安全机制包括 HMAC 签名验证客户端身份与数据完整性，以及挑战应答和随机采样机制，确保上传者真实持有文件内容。", "block_bbox": [43, 1484, 1145, 1546], "block_id": 23, "block_order": 24, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[43.0, 1484.0], [1145.0, 1484.0], [1145.0, 1546.0], [43.0, 1546.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "抽象存储层，支持本地与对象存储实现，验证代码中是否存在磁盘假设，实现本地与云端切换仅需修改存储层接口代码，其余模块无需改动，提升系统可维护性与扩展性。", "block_bbox": [43, 1592, 1146, 1653], "block_id": 24, "block_order": 25, "group_id": 24, "block_polygon_points": [[43.0, 1592.0], [1146.0, 1592.0], [1146.0, 1653.0], [43.0, 1653.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.5147699117660522, "coordinate": [445, 56, 540, 103], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[445.0, 56.0], [540.0, 56.0], [540.0, 103.0], [445.0, 103.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7890806794166565, "coordinate": [205, 129, 780, 156], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[205.0, 129.0], [780.0, 129.0], [780.0, 156.0], [205.0, 156.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.802634060382843, "coordinate": [197, 165, 788, 192], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 165.0], [788.0, 165.0], [788.0, 192.0], [197.0, 192