0, 1339.0], [1136.0, 1339.0], [1136.0, 1438.0], [42.0, 1438.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9095687866210938, "coordinate": [43, 1484, 1145, 1546], "order": 24, "polygon_points": [[43.0, 1484.0], [1145.0, 1484.0], [1145.0, 1546.0], [43.0, 1546.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.911124050617218, "coordinate": [43, 1592, 1146, 1653], "order": 25, "polygon_points": [[43.0, 1592.0], [1146.0, 1592.0], [1146.0, 1653.0], [43.0, 1653.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "# 贾伟\n\n男 | 年龄：29岁 | 15613131123 | 1561313131@163.com\n\n6年工作经验 | 求职意向：Python | 期望薪资：3-5K | 期望城市：衡水\n\n## 个人优势\n\n熟练掌握 Python 后端（Django + DRF、FastAPI + Tortoise-ORM）、Vue3、MySQL、Redis、Docker，具备前后端开发与部署能力；熟练使用 PS、AE、PR，能完成图片处理、视频剪辑与动效制作；掌握 Revit、Blender，具备三维建模与可视化基础；熟练 Office，学习能力强，协作高效。\n\n## 工作经历\n\n2020.07-2024.04\n\n铁路道床建模，房建建筑模型建模以及制作讲解施工工艺的三维动画视频等\n\n业绩：\n\n工作业绩：\n\n1. 负责多种铁路道床的3D建模工作，使用Revit完成大铁铺架施工工艺动画、自密实道床施工工艺动画、钢轨闪光焊施工工艺动画等，提升施工可视化与技术交底效率\n\n2. 参与房建项目投标工作，完成BIM建筑模型的建模任务，助力项目技术方案展示与投标竞争力提升\n\n3. 在施工工艺动画制作过程中，结合BIM技术优化施工流程表达，提高施工团队对工艺要点的理解与执行准确性\n\n## 项目经历\n\n## SimpleYun 简易网盘（个人项目） 全栈工程师\n\n2026.05-2026.08\n\n## 内容：\n\nSimpleYun 简易网盘 | 后端：Python / FastAPI / Tortoise-ORM / Redis / SAQ；前端：Vue 3 / Pinia / Vite\n\n独立完成前后端：分片上传与断点续传、内容寻址秒传、挑战应答与随机采样、多用户共享（多对多+分布式锁）、JWT认证与权限分级。\n\n后端约4600行/31条接口。\n\n业绩：\n\n设计并实现分片上传全链路，包括初始化、幂等分片、进度查询及后台合并，支持断点续传与三路并发上传。合并流程剥离至独立worker进程，确保接口即时返回，提升系统响应效率。\n\n定位并修复一个并发数据丢失缺陷，通过编写最小复现脚本稳定复现“10个分片并发后进度只剩1个”的问题。经实测排除数据库原子表达式（三种写法均报错），最终采用事务+行锁方式串行化临界区，以相同脚本验证10次无丢失，合并文件SHA-256与原始分片逐字节一致。\n\n实现内容寻址秒传功能，基于文件 SHA-256 进行复用，命中后实现零传输完成。关键安全机制包括 HMAC 签名验证客户端身份与数据完整性，以及挑战应答和随机采样机制，确保上传者真实持有文件内容。\n\n抽象存储层，支持本地与对象存储实现，验证代码中是否存在磁盘假设，实现本地与云端切换仅需修改存储层接口代码，其余模块无需改动，提升系统可维护性与扩展性。", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f988de0c-3d50-43a1-af49-4065835eebc0/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-10-17T08%3A58%3A53Z%2F-1%2F%2Fd1de66de6e10c24cbf3e36530cb09d0430570ff9bc2c7eb4b51541a2df18bb8f"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f988de0c-3d50-43a1-af49-4065835eebc0/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-10-17T08%3A58%3A53Z%2F-1%2F%2F829d602fa3729dde1206f1576c0cad177b4b58dd29de075ae399257e2a557f40"}, {"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1192, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "设计文件模型为多对多关系（物理对象 + 用户条目），解决“两个用户无法拥有同名文件”的问题。通过 Redis + Lua 实现分布式锁，保护硬链接引用与引用计数，锁覆盖 link/unlink 全部临界区，避免“建链接时对象被判定归零删除”的数据丢失风险。", "block_bbox": [43, 74, 1146, 136], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[43.0, 74.0], [1146.0, 74.0], [1146.0, 136.0], [43.0, 136.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "实现权限分级与授权机制，采用 JWT 认证与 RBAC 模型，支持对象级权限控制，提升系统安全性与权限管理灵活性。", "block_bbox": [42, 181, 1025, 206], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[42.0, 181.0], [1025.0, 181.0], [1025.0, 206.0], [42.0, 206.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "简易OA办公系统（个人项目） 全栈工程师", "block_bbox": [44, 248, 511, 276], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[44.0, 248.0], [511.0, 248.0], [511.0, 276.0], [44.0, 276.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2025.12-2026.03", "block_bbox": [988, 252, 1146, 274], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[988.0, 252.0], [1145.0, 252.0], [1145.0, 273.0], [988.0, 273.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "内容：", "block_bbox": [44, 293, 101, 317], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[44.0, 293.0], [100.0, 293.0], [100.0, 316.0], [44.0, 316.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "简易OA 办公系统 | 后端：Django + DRF；前端：Vue3 + Pinia；中间件：MySQL + Redis + Celery", "block_bbox": [44, 329, 898, 353], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[44.0, 329.0], [898.0, 329.0], [898.0, 353.0], [44.0, 353.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "独立设计并实现前后端分离的 OA 办公系统后端，核心为自研 JSON 驱动审批工作流引擎，支持线性流转、条件网关、并行分支、会签（含比例通过）、抄送知会、驳回重提、超时催办等完整审批形态，采用事务 + 悲观锁 + 乐观锁版本号三层并发控制保证审批数据一致性。", "block_bbox": [43, 363, 1131, 461], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[43.0, 363.0], [1131.0, 363.0], [1131.0, 461.0], [43.0, 461.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "业绩：", "block_bbox": [44, 480, 101, 503], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[44.0, 480.0], [100.0, 480.0], [100.0, 502.0], [44.0, 502.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "独立设计并实现 OA 办公系统后端，主导开发自研的 JSON 驱动审批工作流引擎。该引擎以 JSON 格式存储流程拓扑，支持 version 多版本共存，实现流程变更不用发版、不用迁移已有实例。引擎原生支持线性流转、条件网关（策略模式，支持 8 种运算符，可运行时扩展）、并行分支、会签（支持 all_approved / any_rejected / any_approved / ratio 四种汇聚策略）、抄送知会、驳回重提、超时催办等完整审批形态。", "block_bbox": [42, 515, 1144, 649], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[42.0, 515.0], [1144.0, 515.0], [1144.0, 649.0], [42.0, 649.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "在并发控制方面，采用事务 + 悲观锁（`SELECT ... FOR UPDATE`）+ 乐观锁版本号三层防护机制，结合 `round_started_at` 轮次隔离，有效解决驳回重提场景下的汇聚计数污染问题。", "block_bbox": [42, 695, 1143, 756], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[42.0, 695.0], [1143.0, 695.0], [1143.0, 756.0], [42.0, 756.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "认证体系采用 JWT 双令牌（access 5min / refresh 7d）+ 刷新轮换 + `jti` 黑名单 + `token_version` 全端下线三层失效机制，鉴权路径通过 Redis 缓存（用户对象 + 黑名单标记）将每次请求的数据库查询从 2 次降至 0 次，并通过 Celery Beat 定时清理过期黑名单，提升系统性能与安全性。", "block_bbox": [42, 802, 1138, 900], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[42.0, 802.0], [1138.0, 802.0], [1138.0, 900.0], [42.0, 900.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "基于 Django Signal 实现审批引擎与业务模块的零耦合解耦，引擎在终态节点派发信号，通知与回写等副作用由订阅方异步处理，订阅方异常不影响主流程，提升系统稳定性与可维护性。", "block_bbox": [42, 946, 1114, 1008], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[42.0, 946.0], [1114.0, 946.0], [1114.0, 1008.0], [42.0, 1008.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "教育经历", "block_bbox": [44, 1058, 169, 1092], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[44.0, 1058.0], [169.0, 1058.0], [169.0, 1092.0], [44.0, 1092.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer", "block_content": "石家庄铁道大学 本科 土木工程", "block_bbox": [43, 1127, 409, 1154], "block_id": 13, "block_order": null, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[43.0, 1127.0], [409.0, 1127.0], [409.0, 1154.0], [43.0, 1154.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer", "block_content": "2016-2020", "block_bbox": [1042, 1129, 1145, 1150], "block_id": 14, "block_order": null, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[1042.0, 1129.0], [1144.0, 1129.0], [1144.0, 1149.0], [1042.0, 1149.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9162506461143494, "coordinate": [43, 74, 1146, 136], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[43.0, 74.0], [1146.0, 74.0], [1146.0, 136.0], [43.0, 136.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8218252062797546, "coordinate": [42, 181, 1025, 206], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[42.0, 181.0], [1025.0, 181.0], [1025.0, 206.0], [42.0, 206.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5306215286254883, "coordinate": [44, 248, 511, 276], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[44.0, 248.0], [511.0, 248.0], [511.0, 276.0], [44.0, 276.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7618162035942078, "coordinate": [988, 252, 1146, 27